---
import '../../styles/global.css';
import '../../styles/event.css';
import '../../styles/event-navigation.css';
import '../../styles/checkout.css';
import EventCheckout from '../../components/EventCheckout.astro';
import SeatMap from '../../components/SeatMap.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { ArrowRight, ArrowUpRight, CalendarDays, MapPin, Ticket, Info, Minus, Plus, ShieldCheck } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es-AR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="Consultá el evento, su ubicación y la disponibilidad de entradas por sector." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#171327" />
  <title>Elegir entradas — TicketYa</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body class="detail-page">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="detail-shell detail-main">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Ubicación en el sitio"><a href="/#catalogo">Eventos</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span id="event-breadcrumb" aria-current="page">Detalle</span></nav>

    <div id="event-state" class="detail-state" aria-busy="true" data-mode="loading">
      <div class="detail-skeleton" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="detail-skeleton-block detail-skeleton-hero"></div>
        <div class="detail-layout"><div class="detail-skeleton-block detail-skeleton-info"></div><div class="detail-skeleton-block detail-skeleton-checkout"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-state-copy">
        <span class="detail-icon"><Ticket size={23} aria-hidden="true" /></span>
        <h1 id="event-state-title" aria-live="polite">Cargando evento y disponibilidad…</h1>
        <p id="event-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <div class="detail-state-actions"><button type="button" id="retry-event" class="button button-blue" hidden>Reintentar</button><a id="back-event-error" class="button detail-secondary" href="/#catalogo" hidden>Volver a explorar <ArrowRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="event-content" hidden>
      <section class="event-banner" aria-labelledby="event-title">
        <img id="event-backdrop" class="event-backdrop" src="/event-placeholder.svg" alt="" />
        <div class="banner-overlay"></div>
        <div class="banner-content">
          <div class="event-labels"><span class="event-pill" id="event-category"></span><span class="availability" id="event-availability"></span></div>
          <h1 id="event-title"></h1>
          <p id="event-artists" class="banner-artists"></p>
          <div class="banner-meta">
            <span><CalendarDays size={18} aria-hidden="true" /><span id="event-date"></span></span>
            <span><MapPin size={18} aria-hidden="true" /><span id="event-location"></span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="event-poster"><img id="event-image" src="/event-placeholder.svg" alt="" width="960" height="600" /></div>
      </section>

      <div class="detail-layout">
        <div class="detail-content">
          <section class="about-event" aria-labelledby="about-title"><h2 id="about-title">Sobre el evento</h2><p id="event-description"></p></section>
          <section class="detail-facts" aria-label="Información para asistir">
            <article><span class="detail-icon"><CalendarDays size={20} aria-hidden="true" /></span><div><h3>Fecha y hora</h3><p id="event-fact-date"></p><p>El horario de apertura de puertas no está informado.</p></div></article>
            <article><span class="detail-icon"><MapPin size={20} aria-hidden="true" /></span><div><h3>Ubicación</h3><p id="event-address"></p><a id="event-map" href="#event-address" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>Ver en el mapa <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div></article>
            <article><span class="detail-icon"><ShieldCheck size={20} aria-hidden="true" /></span><div><h3>Acceso y devoluciones</h3><p>Presentá el QR de tu entrada para registrar el ingreso. Podés solicitar una devolución desde Mis entradas si la compra está aprobada, la entrada está pagada y sin usar, y faltan al menos 72 horas para el evento.</p></div></article>
          </section>
        </div>

        <aside class="booking-section" id="seleccion" aria-labelledby="booking-title" tabindex="-1">
          <header class="booking-heading"><span class="detail-icon"><Ticket size={22} aria-hidden="true" /></span><div><h2 id="booking-title">Elegí tus entradas</h2><p id="event-from-price" hidden></p></div></header>
          <div class="detail-unavailable" id="event-unavailable" hidden>
            <h3 id="event-unavailable-title"></h3><p id="event-unavailable-message"></p>
            <a class="button detail-secondary" href="/#catalogo">Explorar otros eventos <ArrowRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
          </div>
          <div id="booking-controls">
            <div class="inventory-heading"><p id="availability-status" role="status"></p><button class="text-link" type="button" id="refresh-availability">Actualizar cupo</button></div>
            <div class="sector-list" id="sector-list" role="group" aria-label="Sectores del evento"></div>
            <section class="sector-panel" id="sector-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="sector-title">
              <div class="panel-heading"><div><h3 id="sector-title"></h3><p id="sector-kind"></p></div><span class="availability" id="sector-availability"></span></div>
              <div class="general-selector" id="campo-selector" hidden>
                <div class="quantity-info">
                  <label for="quantity">Cantidad de entradas</label>
                  <div class="checkout-stepper">
                    <button type="button" id="subtract-quantity" aria-label="Quitar una entrada" disabled><Minus size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></button>
                    <input id="quantity" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="0" inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="selection-message" />
                    <button type="button" id="add-quantity" aria-label="Agregar una entrada" disabled><Plus size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="numbered-selector" id="numbered-selector" hidden><p class="seat-selection-caption" id="seat-selection-caption"></p><SeatMap id="seat-list" /></div>
              <p class="sector-update" id="sector-update" role="status" hidden></p>
            </section>
            <p class="selection-message" id="selection-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            <section class="order-summary" aria-labelledby="summary-title">
              <h3 id="summary-title">Tu selección</h3>
              <p id="summary-items" aria-live="polite"></p>
              <div class="summary-total"><span>Subtotal estimado</span><strong id="total">—</strong></div>
              <button type="button" class="button detail-primary review-button" id="review-selection" disabled>Revisar selección <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></button>
              <button type="button" id="clear-selection" class="clear-selection" disabled>Limpiar selección</button>
              <a id="choose-profile" class="text-link" href="/login/" hidden>Iniciar sesión para guardar</a>
            </section>
            <p class="booking-note"><Info size={16} aria-hidden="true" /> El precio y el cupo se confirman al comprar.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
      <div id="event-mobile-bar" class="event-mobile-bar" hidden>
        <strong id="mobile-from-price" aria-live="polite"></strong>
        <a href="#seleccion" id="jump-to-sectors" class="button detail-primary">Seleccionar entradas <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
        <button type="button" id="mobile-review-selection" class="button detail-primary" hidden>Revisar selección <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <EventCheckout view="status" />
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
  <EventCheckout view="review" />
  <noscript><p class="detail-shell">Activá JavaScript para consultar el evento y su disponibilidad.</p></noscript>
  <script>import '../../scripts/event';</script>
</body>
</html>
